    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Qutb ud-Din Aibak initiated the construction of the Qutub Minar, which was completed by Iltutmish.",
        "Iltutmish introduced the Iqta administration system and established the Turkan-i-Chahalgani (Group of Forty).",
        "The First Battle of Panipat (1526) resulted in Ibrahim Lodi's defeat and marked the rise of the Mughal Empire."
      ],
